# "Exile that spell instead of putting it into your graveyard as it resolves": a spell that is countered does not resolve
# (CR 701.6a), so it goes to the graveyard and is not plotted. Bot1 casts a Lightning Helix from its hand on turn 3; Lilah's
# triggers resolve, and Bot2 counters the Helix with a Counterspell.

